cession":"0001743881-26-000019"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 3812.0% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1743881/000174388126000019/0001743881-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001743881-26-000019"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 97.7% to 94.9% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001743881"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-54.5% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1743881/000174388126000019/0001743881-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001743881-26-000019"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $1.6m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1743881/000174388126000019/0001743881-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001743881-26-000019"},{"text":"About 14 months of cash at the current burn ($887.8m against $760.4m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1743881/000174388126000019/0001743881-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001743881-26-000019"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$2.3bn) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1743881/000174388126000019/0001743881-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001743881-26-000019"},{"text":"No officer history could be reconstructed from public filings, so the team - the thing that matters most - is the thing we know least about.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001743881"},{"text":"Base rat